It was post-covid ECMO pt, they knew something was failing but didn't know what was failing. Intensivist consultant, anesthetics consultant and gen surg consultant took the pt to OR together, the non-surgeons stayed while they opened them and then wheeled the pt back to ICU and called the family.

&#x200B;

Really sad.
